description:
The objective of the procurement is to retender a Payroll service provider that is expected to deliver value for money, to comply with all contractual obligations and national laws, and to offer high quality of services. The main features of services required:  
- calculation of staff and casual workers' salaries, bonuses; 
- calculation of third party contributions;  
- reporting; 
- payslips; 
- management of salary related issues; 
- preparing leaving papers for departing staff; 
- pay
